  "description": "An extreme survival deserted island BL webtoon arrives!\n\nTwo people crash-land on a deserted island, with no one to rely on but each other. As they struggle to survive life-and-death situations, hidden feelings begin to grow between them?!\n\nFrom sharp-toothed sharks and ferocious monkeys to swarms of night-stalking mosquitoes and mysterious shadows lurking in the jungle - Will the two of them be able to safely escape the island?\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/4450000020), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000098142)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3093001794)  \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3093001795)",
